{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sparrow Warfare</strong></i> is a synergy-rich deckbuilder where you make wild combinations of tiles to free birds and battle against the fiendish Storyteller and his minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/68f29081af90f1bc9f8123671eb18ced.poster.avif?t=1773405609\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/68f29081af90f1bc9f8123671eb18ced.webm?t=1773405609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/68f29081af90f1bc9f8123671eb18ced.mp4?t=1773405609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three is the magic number!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>triple-tile combos</strong> to free birds. Freed birds give you <strong>in-combat rewards</strong> to help you with the <strong>ever-present boss battle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/3e5259f97ebae9923e048d6a4813d56e.avif?t=1773405609\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Going wild</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildtiles</strong> unlock <strong>insane metagaming combos</strong>! You\u2019ll keep coming back for just\u2026 one\u2026 more\u2026 flight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/dcd3b708bf6c2e4f9ab431a6d61544e0.avif?t=1773405609\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elemental play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which Way will your sparrow choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fire</strong> burns<br>\ud83e\ude89 <strong>Song</strong> charms<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Water</strong> multiplies<br>\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Ghosts</strong> protect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the Ways offers unique tiles, new wildtile combinations, and distinct playstyles and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How high can you fly?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>regular game</strong> features a balanced progression system where you battle your way through 6 distinct biomes, each one guarded by a different malevolent boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, <strong>daily flight mode</strong> offers endless replayability with different challenging modifiers and global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/435083723a6511508196649ed140b3ee.avif?t=1773405609\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <i><strong>Deckbuilding:</strong></i> 150+ wildtiles to discover and infinite game-breaking combos to find<br>\u267e\ufe0f <i><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong></i> progressive difficulty, daily flights &amp; challenging modifiers<br>\ud83d\udd25 <i><strong>Multiple Playstyles:</strong></i> suit your personal taste, whether you prefer aggression or cunning<br>\ud83d\udc26\u200d\ud83d\udd25 <i><strong>Big Bird Action:</strong></i> 100+ birds to free, each one featuring real bird sounds<br>\ud83e\udd3a <i><strong>Meta-Strategy:</strong></i> experiment with synergies &amp; build new approaches run after run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/81e9b73b3f8d26f2d8db85ff2b1cbd7a.poster.avif?t=1773405609\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/81e9b73b3f8d26f2d8db85ff2b1cbd7a.webm?t=1773405609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/81e9b73b3f8d26f2d8db85ff2b1cbd7a.mp4?t=1773405609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473440?t=1773405609","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/c8ed8ad906a3a7623dc736dc21f09f3670e55b0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773405609","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/c8f82354d6469d1384459139f2626101bce8ec72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773405609","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/c8f82354d6469d1384459139f2626101bce8ec72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773405609","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4396770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sparrow Warfare</strong></i> is a synergy-rich deckbuilder where you make wild combinations of tiles to free birds and battle against the fiendish Storyteller and his minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473440/extras/68f29081af90f1bc9f8123671eb18ced.poster.avif?t=1773405609\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/